        "question": "Label the load, effort and fulcrum on the diagram below.",
        "marks": 5,
        "model": "Fulcrum — the pivot point, marked at the joint about which the movement occurs.\nEffort — the force applied by the muscle, marked at the point where the muscle inserts onto the bone.\nLoad — the resistance being moved, marked at the weight or body segment at the far end of the lever.",
