        "marks": 5,
        "model": "1. Speak to the team captains and make them responsible for calming their own players, rather than confronting the individuals involved.\n2. Communicate clearly and assertively, explaining the decision and the rule behind it so the situation is defused by information. (Separating the players involved, and applying the available sanctions early and consistently, are equally acceptable.)",
        "diagram": "",
