        "label": "",
        "question": "Having conducted a survey on the physical activity patterns and behaviours of boys and girls in a school, the PE teacher discovered that the boys in the school were far more active than the girls.\nDiscuss two ways in which a school could tackle a gender imbalance in physical activity participation levels.\nDavid Clifford concentrating as he is about to execute a free kick",
