        "question": "Leona Maguire became the first Irish woman to win an event on the LPGA (Ladies Professional Golf Association) Tour - the ‘2022 LPGA Drive On Championship’ in Florida. Leona used PING golf clubs during this event.\nDiscuss the importance of selecting and maintaining suitable equipment in a physical activity of your choice.",
