        "question": "In a physical activity of your choice, state what nutrients an athlete should eat on the day of an event.",
        "marks": 10,
        "model": "Physical activity: hurling (championship match).\nBefore the event: carbohydrate; fluid and electrolytes.\nDuring the event: carbohydrate (fast-acting); fluid and electrolytes.\nAfter the event: carbohydrate; protein; fluid and electrolytes.",
