        "label": "(a) (i)",
        "question": "Integrity is a principle of ethical practice in sport. Define integrity.",
        "marks": 6,
        "model": "Integrity is acting honestly and consistently in line with the rules and moral principles of the sport, whether or not anyone is watching and whether or not it is to one's own advantage.",
        "diagram": "",
