        "label": "(a) (i)",
        "question": "Swim Ireland is the National Governing Body (NGB) for swimming, water polo, diving and artistic swimming in Ireland.\nName two other NGBs for sport in Ireland and the sport that they govern.\nNGB Sport 1:\n2:",
        "marks": 2,
