        "question": "Dublin’s sponsorship deal with AIG is far more lucrative than most sponsorship deals in the GAA.\nDiscuss two advantages and two disadvantages of sponsorship for a physical activity of your choice.\nAdvantage 1 Advantage 2 Disadvantage 1 Disadvantage 2",
