        "label": "(c) (i)",
        "question": "Variable practice involves repeating the skill in a variety of situations, which best suits the development of open skills.\nWhen a coach is designing practice schedules to improve learning and performance in a skill they will look at different types of practice, including variable practice.\nName two other types of practice.",
        "marks": 5,
        "model": "1. Fixed (massed) practice.\n2. Distributed practice.",
