        "question": "Identify the main energy system used for each of the activities below.\nEvent Duration Intensity Main Energy System",
        "marks": 4,
        "model": "Marathon — aerobic (oxidative) system.\n400m — anaerobic lactic system (anaerobic glycolysis).\nLong jump — anaerobic ATP-PC (alactic) system.",
